{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260nSmoZ9Vgm1795166694.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TVB59 周年台慶當晚首辦「東張女神盃」，特別挑選王牌節目《東張西望》中的六大「東張女神」包括陳庭欣、何沛珈、梁敏巧、李旻芳、黎寬怡、甘詠寧，將其以往在節目中不惜一切追尋真相、最真實追訪涉事者的狂奔場面搬上台慶賽道。</p><p></p><p>《萬千星輝賀台慶》「東張女神盃」於 11月19日(周四)晚在 TVB 隆重舉行，在全港觀眾見證下，「東張女神」將化身「跑女」同場決戰 400 米，於真實賽道上跑出「東張精神」，完美 演繹出日常「求真追訪」的勇往直前、堅持不懈的精神。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8f2c1937-eef3-4d68-955b-961342cef7d1.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026GI41jlCqRw1794452143.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"886fd293-bad4-4bde-8f0e-8a30eb554925.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20266InhQJjxII1794452143.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>為隆重其事，TVB早前特假觀塘 HEXAGON DYNAMIC ASIA 健身工作室舉行《萬千星輝賀台慶》「東張女神盃」記者會。六大「東張女神」陳庭欣、何沛珈、梁敏巧、李旻芳、黎寬怡、甘詠寧「東張女神」輪流抽出比賽出場號碼，揀選屬於自己的賽道;為公平競爭，六大「跑女」 亦進行賽前過磅，並呼籲觀眾參與「東張女神盃」競猜遊戲投票，冀「女神」們發揮水準，順利跑出。記者會司儀由關曜儁擔任。</p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2026ElsYQqQwqk1795092246.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fnh0FyLLIj1795166252.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><br/></p><p><p><img alt=\"2026hlfYVGgEOl1795092261.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CJKcosBrEg1795166261.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2026oaz82A9gWN1795091948.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WKqLcsrg0v1795166267.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"20264DT6kQ3oin1795091963.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VTJmXoPZiv1795166274.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><br/>6位東張女神包括李旻芳、梁敏巧、黎寬怡、甘詠寧、何沛珈、陳庭欣手持咪進行400米跑步比賽，最終李旻芳奪得第一名，何沛珈包尾！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:23:59.695006+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":482,"images":7,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T09:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T04:17:11.958569+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:17:18.774129+00:00","content_hash":"909c4539ce90eeccf8e84f1c094e2a12bd7a8c5fc68c456ff5e8b66a11014086","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:23:59.695006+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}